1790186210345480	edict-6jkvat	itc:v3:AWKZJOSZmZmZ8lAAAAAAQbVdW222-oAAAAExBA		item.create	bn-2c38	{"description":"Following .agents/edict/security-review.md verbatim fails before launch (observed 2026-09-23 on cr-2dajj1).\n1. rite claims stake --ttl takes seconds: '--ttl 20m' exits 'invalid digit found in string'. Use --ttl 1200.\n2. vessel spawn --cwd \".maw/workspaces/$ws\" resolves against the vessel server's cwd, not the caller's: 'cannot resolve working directory'. Use an absolute path, e.g. --cwd \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/.maw/workspaces/$ws\".\nWhere: src/templates/docs/security-review.md (and any template test asserting the old text).","kind":"bug","title":"security-review.md launch contract: --ttl 20m rejected by rite, relative vessel --cwd fails"}	blake3:rnU3aVH4aVRGqycDW_yFmhhnp3TdM30UnQee8li_XHc
