1790186962580925	edict-6jkvat	itc:v3:AWKZJOSZmZmZ8lAAAAAAQbVdW222-oAAAAExBg		item.create	bn-w912	{"description":"Observed on cr-2dajj1 (2026-09-23): after fix commits, 'seal reviews request' kept target_commit at the old detached anchor. Only 'seal reviews retarget <id>' (seal 0.29) moves the review to the workspace HEAD and clears votes. review-response.md, security-review.md, the managed Reviews section and protocol review guidance say only 're-request'. The dedicated reviewer then verifies the stale target. Add 'maw exec $WS -- seal reviews retarget <id>' before every re-request.","kind":"bug","title":"Re-review docs omit seal reviews retarget; re-request leaves the review on the old commit"}	blake3:hVwT8nSsFVuU8BzKlBxINoo6G9Amvz7d2Y2k830Dty4
