1790191838398312	edict-6jkvat	itc:v3:AWKZJOSZmZmZ8lAAAAAAQbVdW222-oAAAAExCQ		item.create	bn-3cc4	{"description":"From cr-2dajj1 thread th-1jjmub. find_bone_for_workspace accepts a bone only when the caller's --agent holds its claim. With no such claim, protocol merge proceeds without a bone, --force skips the review gate, and the risk:critical label check (added in bn-2f92) never runs. Decide the --force policy: fail closed when --force meets an unresolved bone, or bind workspace to bone through an immutable source (for example the Seal review title) and check its labels before honoring --force. Policy decision, so split from bn-2f92.","kind":"bug","title":"protocol merge --force skips the risk:critical gate when no bone is linked to the workspace"}	blake3:Z916QMVO8QRXq6kY3TNggbxv-ifJaAZ0zs7F_3X3Ro0
