1790470519505562	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-2c38	{"field":"description","value":"Following .agents/edict/security-review.md verbatim fails before launch (observed 2026-09-23 on cr-2dajj1).\n\n1. rite claims stake --ttl takes seconds: '--ttl 20m' exits 'invalid digit found in string'. Use --ttl 1200.\n2. vessel spawn --cwd \"{{ ws_prefix }}$ws\" is relative and resolves against the vessel server's cwd, not the caller's: 'cannot resolve working directory'. Use an absolute path, e.g. --cwd \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)/{{ ws_prefix }}$ws\" (must work for both bare ws/ and .maw/workspaces layouts).\n\nWhere: src/templates/docs/security-review.md lines ~49 and ~57, plus any template/render test asserting the old text.\n\nAcceptance:\n- Template renders --ttl 1200 and an absolute --cwd for both maw layouts.\n- A test asserts the rendered doc contains no relative --cwd and no unit-suffixed --ttl.\n- cargo test passes; edict sync --check against this repo reports the updated doc as the managed copy."}	blake3:_o-3hiX4Cd2xmNM6eDwScBMQYsXmuc7WeNIdkbnVjbg
1790470519511302	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-2c38	{"field":"size","value":"xs"}	blake3:9dDXgHhMzpcR2ak5-L_vFpTMnmMxr4buriYTIN_GSOw
1790470519531014	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-w912	{"field":"description","value":"Observed on cr-2dajj1 (2026-09-23): after fix commits, 'seal reviews request' kept target_commit at the old detached anchor. Only 'seal reviews retarget <id>' (seal 0.29) moves the review to the workspace HEAD and clears votes. The docs and prompts say only 're-request', so the dedicated reviewer verifies the stale target.\n\nFix: emit 'maw exec $WS -- seal reviews retarget <id>' before every re-request.\n\nFiles that mention re-request (audit each):\n- src/templates/docs/review-response.md, review-request.md, security-review.md, worker-loop.md\n- src/templates/agents-managed.md.jinja (managed Reviews section)\n- src/commands/protocol/{review,review_gate,resume,finish,merge,render,shell}.rs (protocol guidance that prints commands)\n- src/commands/dev_loop/prompt.rs, src/commands/worker_loop.rs, src/reply.rs\n\nAcceptance:\n- Every place that tells an agent to re-request after new commits tells it to retarget first.\n- Protocol command output (edict protocol review/resume) includes the retarget step when a review already exists; covered by unit tests.\n- A doc/template test fails if 're-request' appears without a retarget step in the same block.\n- AGENTS.md seal section (and the managed block after edict sync) documents retarget.\n\nSequencing: after bn-2c38 (both edit security-review.md)."}	blake3:jVyQ778AjBM8nd5jYVYhw_DgNodQBrJWAsoPVA26SAw
1790470519536589	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-w912	{"field":"size","value":"s"}	blake3:GEwfEolitsncC01_fnO-mlWc7XFVWL8ANug51vMJAlM
