1790471959980710	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2d57	{"body":"Root cause: pi's openai-codex OAuth refresh token was revoked ('invalid_refresh_token'). Responder triage used hardcoded openai-codex/gpt-5.6-luna:high with no fallback -> pi fails in <1s -> ToolFailed exit 4. Reproduced 2026-09-26 from /home/bob/src/rite (exit 4 in 0.49s). Fix cad89670: triage falls back to the default model, auth failures get an actionable one-line error, edict doctor checks pi auth per provider. Still needed: re-login pi to openai-codex (run pi, /login)."}	blake3:urYW0sjWYKFpzqbqtFdtiGOV68rRHe8_q5GQ9u7gvTE
