1790473054700552	edict-12wg8u	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3t3i	{"description":"bn-lq0r refuses rite hook registration for temp-dir projects when RITE_DATA_DIR is unset, but edict init also runs 'rite send' to #projects to register the project. That still writes into the live rite data dir from a throwaway project. Apply the same guard decision (rite_hook_guard::decide) to that send (skip with a note, honoring --allow-live-hooks), and cover it in tests/rite_hook_guard_refuses_live_hooks.rs by asserting no #projects message in the sentinel data dir.","kind":"task","labels":["rite"],"parent":"bn-3cud","size":"xs","title":"Extend the temp-dir guard to init's #projects registration send"}	blake3:xuyoAGM7ycrJ_wMa4q573vPcXfH6_hc4Dsr_xMWnqPQ
