1790555126988101	edict-83n310	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3pto	{"body":"Filed in the maw repo as bn-39nsp (bones, /home/bob/src/maw). Not posted to #maw: a channel message would wake maw's live responder hook; the bone lands in maw's own triage instead. Also noted maw has 'maw tldr' — the rewrite should point at it."}	blake3:RZyRYHiZxxv_H31eu24Woxk0j9Y-rsrqmvkzfT5GYMI
