1790555133027338	edict-83n310	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-21zp	{"body":"maw has 'maw tldr' (quick cheat sheet) as well as --help; point at maw tldr like bn tldr and rite tldr. maw's help examples omit --message and use --from origin/main (reported upstream as maw bn-39nsp), so the Rules list must keep the edict merge path explicit."}	blake3:t1F1RWui5nrs-fXfQIm1DE0l0EkVBsNvYwip7xNJozM
